{"title": "Xyanyde's Fire", "pageid": 28796, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Xyanyde's_Fire", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Xyanyde's Fire</b> is a passive feature that lights up the wearer's target if they miss, making them easier to hit next turn.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Once per <a href=\"/wiki/Short_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Short rest\">short rest</a>, you can encase a target in <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Faerie_Fire_(Condition)\" title=\"Faerie Fire (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a5/Faerie_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Faerie_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a5/Faerie_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Faerie_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a5/Faerie_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Faerie_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Faerie Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a5/Faerie_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Faerie_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a5/Faerie_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Faerie_Fire_(Condition)\" title=\"Faerie Fire (Condition)\">Faerie Fire</a> for 2 turns if you miss an attack against it. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Faerie_Fire\"> Condition: Faerie Fire </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Faerie_Fire_(Condition)\" title=\"Faerie Fire (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a5/Faerie_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Faerie_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a5/Faerie_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Faerie_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a5/Faerie_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Faerie_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Faerie Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a5/Faerie_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Faerie_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a5/Faerie_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Faerie_Fire_(Condition)\" title=\"Faerie Fire (Condition)\">Faerie Fire</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 2  turns</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Shedding dim light. Incoming attacks have <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a>. Cannot be <a href=\"/wiki/Condition#Invisible\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Condition\">Invisible</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the weapons:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Xyanyde\" title=\"Xyanyde\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8f/Mace_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Mace_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8f/Mace_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Mace_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8f/Mace_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Mace_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8f/Mace_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Mace_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8f/Mace_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Xyanyde\" title=\"Xyanyde\">Xyanyde</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Minthara\" title=\"Minthara\">Minthara</a></li></ul>\n</div>    <div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">Once per <a href=\"/wiki/Short_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Short rest\">short rest</a>, can encase a target in <a href=\"/wiki/Faerie_Fire\" title=\"Faerie Fire\">Faerie Fire</a> for 2 turns after missing an attack against it.</div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714203257\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.049 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.056 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1551/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 14368/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 3501/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 127/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.009/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 873159/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   49.658      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   49.658      1 -total\n 26.06%   12.940      1 Template:Cond\n 21.85%   10.849      1 Template:Passive_weapons_list\n 20.40%   10.132      2 Template:Icon_link\n 19.62%    9.744      2 Template:Icon_text\n 19.01%    9.440     12 Template:Trim\n 18.08%    8.976      1 Template:Condition_inline/format\n 17.18%    8.533      1 Template:Condition\n 15.11%    7.502      4 Template:Ifempty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:28796-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714203257 and revision id 371291. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}